  "headline": "Labetalol hydrochloride supply traces to a plant with multiple VAI inspections; not on FDA shortage list today",
  "headline_cites": ["E9", "E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies Heritage Pharma Labs Inc. d/b/a Avet Pharmaceuticals Labs Inc. (FEI 3005139373) as the manufacturing plant for labetalol hydrochloride NDC 23155072305.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA records show that plant received Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI) classifications after inspections ending 2009-07-14, 2013-11-21, 2014-01-08, 2015-04-16, 2017-04-20, and 2018-02-06.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The most recent inspection on file ended 2018-02-06 with a VAI classification.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The drug is not listed on FDA's shortage list as of today.",
      "cites": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 301 units on hand at 11.4 units per day (26 days supply) and Corvale General has 297 units at 13.8 units per day (22 days supply).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended buy option is A-S Medication Solutions, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Verify current availability with A-S Medication Solutions and monitor FDA shortage listings for any future posting.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
